{"speciesId":547,"names":{"fr":"Farfaduvet","es":"Whimsicott","en":"Whimsicott","ja":"エルフーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se faufile comme le vent par les espaces les plus étroits, en laissant une touffe de poils blancs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il apparaît dans un tourbillon de vent, s’introduit dans les maisons par les interstices et y joue de mauvais tours."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Riding whirlwinds, they appear. These Pokémon sneak through gaps into houses and cause all sorts of mischief."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il apparaît dans un tourbillon de vent, s’introduit dans les maisons et y joue de mauvais tours."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aparecen en medio de un torbellino y entran en las casas para descolocar los muebles o esparcir algodón por doquier."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"つむじかぜと ともに 現われて 家の 中の 家具を 動かしたり 綿を 残す いたずらをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se faufile comme le vent par les espaces les plus étroits, en laissant une touffe de poils blancs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es capaz de atravesar las más mínimas fisuras. A su paso, deja bolitas blancas de pelo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"どんなに 細い すきまでも 風のように 潜り抜けてしまう。 白い 毛玉を 残していく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il apparaît dans un tourbillon de vent, s’introduit dans les maisons et y joue de mauvais tours."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aparecen en medio de un torbellino y entran en las casas para descolocar los muebles o esparcir algodón por doquier."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"つむじかぜと ともに 現われて 家の 中の 家具を 動かしたり 綿を 残す いたずらをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il se faufile comme le vent par les espaces les plus étroits, en laissant une touffe de poils blancs."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Es capaz de atravesar las más mínimas fisuras. A su paso, deja bolitas blancas de pelo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"どんなに 細い すきまでも 風のように 潜り抜けてしまう。 白い 毛玉を 残していく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il s’introduit chez les gens à la faveur d’un courant d’air, répand du coton aux quatre coins de la pièce puis repart comme si de rien n’était."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Entra en las casas con las corrientes de aire y esparce algodón por todas partes. Desaparece entre risas tras su travesura."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It rides on the wind and slips into people’s homes. After it has turned a room into a cotton- filled mess, it giggles to itself and takes off."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"風に 乗り 民家に 侵入。 部屋中を 綿まみれに すると ニコニコ 笑って 去っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon se déplace au gré du vent. Lorsqu’il souffle trop fort, il arrive que Farfaduvet perde le coton qu’il porte sur sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Aparece al levantarse el viento, pero, cuando este arrecia, pierde el algodón de la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon appears, riding upon the wind. But if the wind gusts up, it’ll blow the cotton on this Pokémon’s head clean off."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"風に 乗って 現れるが あまりに 風が 強すぎると 頭の 綿が 千切れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce petit chenapan s’introduit chez les gens, cache leurs affaires et répand du coton aux quatre coins de la pièce."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este travieso Pokémon entra sigilosamente en las casas, esconde los objetos valiosos y dispersa bolas de algodón por todas partes."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This nuisance sneaks into people’s homes, where it hides important things and scatters cotton all over the place."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"民家に 忍び込み 大切な ものを 隠したり 部屋中に 綿を まき散らす 厄介者だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon sans domicile fixe se laisse porter par les tornades et sème la zizanie partout où il passe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon no vive en un lugar determinado, sino que se deja llevar por los torbellinos para desplazarse y realizar sus travesuras."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Whimsicott doesn’t live in a fixed location. It floats around on whirling winds, appearing all over the place to perform its mischief."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"特定の 棲み処を 持たない。 つむじ風に 乗って あちこちに 現れては イタズラを するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il joue de mauvais tours en répandant son coton. Si on le mouille, il s’alourdit et ne peut plus bouger, ce qui l’oblige à s’avouer vaincu."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este travieso Pokémon se divierte esparciendo bolas de algodón. Al mojarlo, su peso aumenta tanto que no logra moverse y se da por vencido."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, it’ll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"綿を まき散らし イタズラする。 水を かけると 重くなって 動けなくなり 観念するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son coton se met à gonfler sous les rayons du soleil. Quand il est trop volumineux, il s’effiloche et se répand aux alentours."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su algodón se expande cuando recibe los rayos del sol, pero acaba desprendiéndose si se vuelve demasiado voluminoso."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"As long as this Pokémon bathes in sunlight, its cotton keeps growing. If too much cotton fluff builds up, Whimsicott tears it off and scatters it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"日の光を 浴びるたび 綿が 膨らんでいく。 膨らみすぎると ちぎって あたりに まき散らす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":547,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"razor-leaf","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"n